nd fragrant"},{"surface":"பந்தர்","parts":[{"text":"பந்தர்","lemma":"pantar","gloss":"arbor"}],"gloss":"arbor"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கூந்தல்","parts":[{"text":"கூந்தல்","lemma":"kūntal","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"hair"},{"surface":"கொய்து","parts":[{"text":"கொய்","lemma":"koy","gloss":"cut"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having cut"},{"surface":"குறுந்தொடு","parts":[{"text":"குறுந்தொடு","lemma":"குறுந்தொடு","gloss":"small bracelets"}],"gloss":"small bracelets","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நீக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நீக்கு","lemma":"nīkku","gloss":"remove"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having removed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அல்லி","parts":[{"text":"அல்லி","lemma":"alli","gloss":"water lily"}],"gloss":"water lily"},{"surface":"உணவின்","parts":[{"text":"உணவு","lemma":"uṇavu","gloss":"food"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"genitive suffix"}],"gloss":"of food"},{"surface":"மனைவியடு","parts":[{"text":"மனைவி","lemma":"maṉaivi","gloss":"wife"},{"text":"அடு","lemma":"aṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"along with his wife"},{"surface":"இனியே","parts":[{"text":"இனி","lemma":"iṉi","gloss":"now"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"now indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புல்","parts":[{"text":"புல்","lemma":"pul","gloss":"desolate"}],"gloss":"desolate"},{"surface":"என்றனையால்","parts":[{"text":"என்று","lemma":"eṉṟu","gloss":"having become"},{"text":"அனை","lemma":"aṉai","gloss":"you became"},{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"āl","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"you have become"},{"surface":"வளங்கெழு","parts":[{"text":"வளம்","lemma":"vaḷam","gloss":"wealth"},{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"keḻu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"wealth-possessing"},{"surface":"திருநகர்","parts":[{"text":"திரு","lemma":"tiru","gloss":"beautiful"},{"text":"நகர்","lemma":"nakar","gloss":"mansion"}],"gloss":"beautiful mansion"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வான்","parts":[{"text":"வான்","lemma":"vāṉ","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white"},{"surface":"சோறு","parts":[{"text":"சோறு","lemma":"cōṟu","gloss":"cooked rice"}],"gloss":"cooked rice"},{"surface":"கொண்டு","parts":[{"text":"கொண்டு","lemma":"கொண்டு","gloss":"having taken"}],"gloss":"having taken","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தீம்பால்","parts":[{"text":"தீம்","lemma":"tīm","gloss":"sweet"},{"text":"பால்","lemma":"pāl","gloss":"milk"}],"gloss":"sweet milk"},{"surface":"வேண்டும்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டு","lemma":"vēṇṭu","gloss":"want"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"habitual suffix"}],"gloss":"wanting"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முனித்தலை","parts":[{"text":"முனி","lemma":"muṉi","gloss":"shaven"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"head"}],"gloss":"shaven heads"},{"surface":"புதல்வர்","parts":[{"text":"புதல்வர்","lemma":"putalvar","gloss":"children"}],"gloss":"children"},{"surface":"தந்தை","parts":[{"text":"தந்தை","lemma":"tantai","gloss":"father"}],"gloss":"father"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தனித்தலை","parts":[{"text":"தனி","lemma":"taṉi","gloss":"solitary"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"solitary place"},{"surface":"பெருங்காடு","parts":[{"text":"பெருங்காடு","lemma":"பெருங்காடு","gloss":"great cremation ground"}],"gloss":"great cremation ground","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"முன்னிய","parts":[{"text":"முன்னு","lemma":"muṉṉu","gloss":"approach"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"who reached"},{"surface":"பின்னே","parts":[{"text":"பின்","lemma":"piṉ","gloss":"after"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"after"}]}],"literal":"Cooked rice with rich thick sauce abundant with the sound of seasoning, / patrons at the gate who stopped suppliants, / under the cool fragrant arbor that stopped tears, / having cut her hair and removed her small bracelets, / along with his wife whose food is water lily seeds, now, / you have become desolate, O prosperous beautiful mansion! / Wanting sweet milk with white rice, / the father of the children with shaven heads, / after he reached the solitary great cremation ground.","translation":"O prosperous, beautiful mansion! You have now become desolate. The patron who stood at your gate, stopping suppliants only to feed them cooked rice with rich, thick sauce that sizzled with the sound of seasoning, and who stopped their tears under his cool, fragrant arbor, has now reached the solitary, great cremation ground. After his departure, his wife has cut her hair, removed her small bracelets, and now eats only water lily seeds; and his children with shaven heads, who once cried for sweet milk to mix with their white rice, are left fatherless.","modern":"தாளிக்கும் சத்தம் நிறைந்த, கொழுவிய துவையல் உடைய உணவை வழங்கி, இரவலர்களைத் தன் வாயிலிலேயே தடுத்து நிறுத்தி உபசரித்த வள்ளல் அவர். இரவலர்களின் கண்ணீரைத் துடைத்த குளிர்ந்த நறுமணப் பந்தலைக் கொண்ட அந்தச் செல்வம் நிறைந்த அழகிய மாளிகையே! இப்போது நீ பொலிவிழந்து கிடக்கிறாய். வெள்ளைச் சோற்றுடன் இனிமையான பாலைக் கலந்து உண்ண விரும்பும் மொட்டையடித்த தலையையுடைய சிறுவர்களின் தந்தையான அந்த வள்ளல், தனிமையான பெரிய சுடுகாட்டை அடைந்த பின்பு, அவனது மனைவி தன் கூந்தலைச் சவரம் செய்து, வளையல்களை நீக்கி, அல்லி விதைகளை மட்டுமே உணவாகக் கொண்டு வாழ்கிறாள்.","explanation":"This poem is set in the Purappāṭṭu genre under the theme of 'Tāpata Nilai' (the state of widowhood/asceticism) in the Tiṇai of 'Potuviyal'. The poet, Tāyaṅ Kaṇṇiyār, addresses the mansion of a deceased patron, lamenting its sudden desolation. He recalls how the patron used to feed suppliants with rich, seasoned food and dry their tears under his cool arbor. Now, after the patron has departed to the cremation ground, his wife has shaved her head, discarded her bracelets, and eats only water lily seeds. His young children, who used to demand sweet milk with their white rice, are left without their father, and the once-glorious mansion stands empty and ruined.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.97],[1.97,2.83],[2.